# Keep drafts local until they're turned in. The proposal is published; the paper
# (and everything else here) stays local until it is turned in.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!Proposal/
!Proposal/**
# The final source list is published too. Git can't see a file inside an ignored folder,
# so edison/ is let through first; everything else new in it stays ignored.
!edison/
!edison/Final_Selection.md
